    "title": "GATEWAY-apiwizruntimedoc-List Logistics Shipments Historys-v1-spec",
    "description": "The Logistics Shipments History API enables users to access historical data on logistics shipments efficiently. This API allows clients to retrieve detailed information about past shipments, including statuses, tracking information, and timestamps. It caters to businesses in the logistics and supply chain sectors that require visibility into their shipment history for reporting, analysis, and operational decision-making. Typical consumers of this API include logistics managers, supply chain analysts, and third-party logistics providers seeking to enhance their shipment tracking capabilities.",
